  8→/**
  9→ * GOLDEN RATIO LADDER GRID - SCROLL-DRIVEN ARCADE
 10→ *
 11→ * Animation: Scroll-linked arcade flicker/pulse
 12→ * - Scroll position = animation progress
 13→ * - Scroll speed = animation speed
 14→ * - Reversible - scroll up and cards fade back out
 15→ * - Like dashboard gauges powering on as you scan across them
 16→ */
 17→
